## The source pans its brown-noise bed; entrain
## beds are wide decorrelated stereo, so the bed plays centered-full.
##
## Minimal and low-intensity: brown-noise bed, 250 Hz carrier, beats
## 10 <-> 5 Hz. For rest, light meditation, quiet background use.

